id: pan-long-flick
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: Flick the long page: the card arrives with content to the bottom, nothing blank enters from below, the header's rows hold (the stream's stale and uniform bands)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
known: T-567 stream-uniform; T-567 stream-stale
kit: cavekit-gpu-rendering.md R3
stream: --rows 138-1024 --still 82-138
stream-mojo: --rows 84-945
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
stream-start 16 -c 0-756 -U 48
flick 480 900 480 300
flick 480 900 480 300
drag 480 300 480 900
stream-stop
expect stream stale 0
expect stream uniform 0
expect card-scroll-min 300
